WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.325
Kurosh's division ring problem fails.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.359
Kurosh, nineteen forty-one: must algebraic division rings be locally finite?

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.018
Solve equations step by step, so that

4
00:00:11.018 --> 00:00:13.136
in the limit every element is algebraic.

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.523
Claimed: two generators, infinite dimension, all algebraic.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.221
No Lean proof yet.
